# Build context for deploy/server/Dockerfile. assets/ is intentionally NOT excluded here even
# though .gitignore ignores it — the real assets/ directory must be present on disk (see
# deploy/README.md) so the Docker build can COPY it into both build and runtime stages.

.git
.gradle
.idea
.claude
*.iml
*.log
**/build/
**/.gradle/
lwjgl3/icons
lwjgl3/src/main/resources
